# Push Quality Gate

- Before any `git push`, run checks in this order: `npm run lint` then `npm run build`.
- Do not push if either command fails.
- If checks fail, fix the issue first, then rerun both commands sequentially.
- When asked to push, report lint/build outcomes before executing the push.
